{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QuantumBlochGroup","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QuantumBlochGroup","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Defs"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.quantum_torus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.quantum_torus","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Quantum-torus relation `u v = q (v u)` driving the pentagon identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.v","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Second quantum-torus generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.u","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.lean#L36-L36","doc":"First quantum-torus generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBlochGroup.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBlochGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBlochGroup","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.lean#L26-L40","doc":"The **quantum Bloch group** `𝔅(q)(R)` generating datum: a\nquantum-torus pair `(u, v)` in an `R`-algebra `A` satisfying\n`u * v = q • (v * u)`.  This is exactly the relation under which the\nquantum-dilogarithm pentagon identity\n`Φ_q(u) Φ_q(v) = Φ_q(v) Φ_q(u v) Φ_q(u)` (Yang–Baxter in exponential\nform) holds, and it linearises to the Hecke relation\n`σ² = (q − q⁻¹) σ + 1` on the traced volumes. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:quantum-bloch-group","label":"def:quantum-bloch-group","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-bloch-group.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}